# An opponent's closed kan (ankan) cancels a riichi seat's ippatsu
# (engine.md §4.2 Ippatsu, rules.md §4.26).
# Seat 0 declares double riichi and discards 9m.
# Seat 1 draws 4th 9p and declares ankan 9p -> cancels Seat 0's ippatsu!
# Seat 1 draws rinshan 7s and discards 7s -> Seat 0 rons 7s WITHOUT ippatsu!
# Scoring for Seat 0 (dealer, East):
#   Hand: 234m 678m 234p 56s 88p + ron 7s (dora ind 1z, 2z; ura 1z, 2z -> 0 dora)
#   Yaku: double_riichi (2) + pinfu (1) + tanyao (1) = 4 han 30 fu (NO ippatsu!)
#   Dealer 4 han 30 fu ron = 11600 from Seat 1 (with ippatsu it would be 12000).

[meta]
